idden command structure, total control, unlawful conduct, criminal intent, or a completed world-system plan.</p></section><section class="section"><h2>Missing Records</h2><p>Find primary record, dated official source, counter-evidence and exact affected page before increasing confidence.; Find primary record, dated official source, counter-evidence and exact affected page before increasing confidence.; Find primary record, dated official source, counter-evidence and exact affected page before increasing confidence.; Find primary record, dated official source, counter-evidence and exact affected page before increasing confidence.; Find primary record, dated official source, counter-evidence and exact affected page before increasing confidence.</p><h2>What Would Strengthen It</h2><ul><li>official documents naming implementation routes</li><li>multiple independent primary public records</li><li>dated policy/legal text</li><li>source-ledger entries with direct URLs</li><li>card dossiers with reviewed source routes</li></ul><h2>What Would Falsify It</h2><ul><li>source corrections</li><li>identity mismatch</li><li>official records showing decentralised or unrelated causes</li><li>missing implementation plan</li><li>strong counter-evidence from primary records</li></ul></section><section class="section"><h2>Related Cards</h2><div class="theory-grid"><article class="theory-card"><h3>People</h3><p>No reviewed entries yet.</p></article><article class="theory-card"><h3>Institutions</h3><ul><li>World Economic Forum</li><li>World Health Organization</li><li>Bank for International Settlements</li><li>International Monetary Fund</li><li>World Bank</li><li>Federal Reserve System</li><li>European Commission</li><li>World Trade Organization</li></ul></article><article class="theory-card"><h3>Policies</h3><ul><li>UN Sustainable Development Goals</li><li>UN Pact for the Future</li><li>WHO Pandemic Agreement</li><li>International Health Regulations amendments</li><li>Pathogen Access and